   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Number of biodiversity finance solutions developed</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">4.1.1 Comprehensive proposal of finance solutions, including actions to enhance existing finance flows, drafted. and reviewed through a national stakeholder consultation 
4.1.2 Finance solutions prioritized and used to develop technical proposals and a national biodiversity finance plan, validated by stakeholders. 
4.1.3 Risk management plans / frameworks based on assessment of socio-economic trade-offs and social and environmental impacts of proposed biodiversity finance solutions for post-project implementation of national Biodiversity Finance Plans.
4.1.4. Scenarios proposed for implementation of biodiversity finance solutions informed by socio-economic / poverty assessments (i.e., the main deliverables are the scenarios for the solutions, based on the socio-economic assessments).</narrative>
    </description>
